## Communications
MOF–Polymer Composites
MOFs packed with polystyrene: An unprecedented mode of reactivity of one of the best studied metal–organic frameworks, MOF-5, offers a powerful approach to polymer-hybridized porous solids. A MOF-5-polystyrene (MOF-5-PS)
composite was directly produced from the monomer styrene. In the MOF-5-PS composites, polystyrene is grafted and uniformly distributed throughout, which leads to enhanced hydrolytic stability and unique guest adsorption.
